msgstr "&lt;Nome da organización&gt;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:326
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If none of the above types fit your needs you can select the "
"<guilabel>Custom</guilabel> name type, where you can add your own formatted "
"name &mdash; this configuration can be done in the name edit dialog. To "
"specify a default formatted name type for new contacts, use the <link "
"linkend=\"preferences-address-book-contact\">configure dialog</link>."
msgstr ""
"Se ningún dos tipos anteriores se axeita ás súas necesidades, pode "
"seleccionar o tipo de nome <guilabel>Personalizado</guilabel> e engadir o "
"seu nome personalizado &mdash; esta configuración pódese facer no diálogo de "
"edición do nome. Para especificar un tipo de nome formatado por omisión para "
"os seus contactos, empregue o <link linkend=\"preferences-address-book-"
"contact\">diálogo de configuración</link>"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:336
#, no-c-format
msgid "Phone Numbers"
msgstr "Números de teléfono"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:337
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Here you can enter your contact's phone numbers. As well as land-lines and "
"mobile/cell number, Fax, ISDN and many other types are possible. The number "
"can contain almost any character, so it is possible to format the number in "
"any way you need, including adding letters."
msgstr ""
"Aquí pode introducir os números de teléfono do contacto. Son posíbeis "
"teléfonos fixos, telemóbies, fax, RDSI. O número pode conter practicamente "
"calquer carácter, de xeito que é posíbel formatar o número da maneira que "
"queira, mesmo engadindo letras."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:339
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "If three numbers aren't enough, simply press the <guilabel>Add</guilabel> "
#| "button to get additional fields to enter a number."
msgid ""
"If three numbers aren't enough, simply press the <guibutton>Add</guibutton> "
"button to get additional fields to enter a number."
msgstr ""
"Se non lle abondan tres números, simplemente prema o botón "
"<guilabel>Engadir</guilabel> para obter campos adicionais nos que introducir "
"números."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:341
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If the type of the number is either a Phone, Mobile phone or Fax number you "
"can select a script to be executed when clicking on it. (under Configuration "
"→ General)"
msgstr ""
"Se o tipo de número é teléfono, telemóbel ou número de fax, pode seleccionar "
"un guión que se execute ao premer nel (en Configuración  → Xeral)"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:347
#, no-c-format
msgid "Addresses"
msgstr "Enderezos"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:348
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "Here you can enter your contact's addresses. You can do so by pressing "
#| "the <guibutton>Edit Addresses...</guibutton> Button and simply enter the "
#| "<guilabel>Street</guilabel>, <guilabel>Post Office Box</guilabel>, "
#| "<guilabel>Locality</guilabel>, <guilabel>Postal Code</guilabel>, and "
#| "<guilabel>Country</guilabel>. After you do so you can look up the address "
#| "on the map by simply clicking on the address (you can change the map-"
#| "service/string used by &kaddressbook; in its settings."
msgid ""
"Here you can enter your contact's addresses. You can do so by pressing the "
"<guibutton>Edit Addresses...</guibutton> Button and simply enter the "
"<guilabel>Street</guilabel>, <guilabel>Post Office Box</guilabel>, "
"<guilabel>Locality</guilabel>, <guilabel>Postal Code</guilabel>, and "
"<guilabel>Country</guilabel>. After you do so you can look up the address on "
"the map by simply clicking on the address (you can change the map-service/"
"string used by &kaddressbook; in its settings)."
msgstr ""
"Aquí pode introducir os enderezos dos contactos. Pódeo facer premenno o "
"botón <guibutton>Editar Enderezos...</guibutton> e simplemente introducindo "
"a <guilabel>Rúa</guilabel>, <guilabel>Apartado de Correos</guilabel>, "
"<guilabel>Localidade</guilabel>, <guilabel>Código Postal</guilabel> e "
"<guilabel>País</guilabel>. Unha vez feito, pode consultar o enderezo no mapa "
"simplemente premendo no enderezo (pode mudar a cade do servizo de mapas que "
"utiliza &kaddressbook; na súa configuración)."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:349
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can also create a label, which will be shown instead of the real address "
"(however, the map lookup, will use the real address)."
msgstr ""
"Tamén pode crear unha etiqueta, que se mostrará no canto do enderezo real "
"(porén, a consulta no mapa utilizará o enderezo real)."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:350
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can also have set different addresses (i.e. one for work and one for "
"home). It's also possible to set two different <guilabel>Home</guilabel> "
"addresses."
msgstr ""
"Tamén pode indicar enderezos diferentes (p.ex., un para o traballo e outro "
"para a casa). Tamén é posíbel consigar dous enderezos distintos para a "
"<guilabel>Casa</guilabel>."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:354
#, no-c-format
msgid "Emails"
msgstr "Correos electrónicos"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:355
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can enter email addresses for your contact here. You can set one address "
"as standard."
msgstr ""
"Pode introducir aquí os enderezos de correo electrónico dos seus contactos. "
"Pode indicar que un sexa o normal."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:356
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you set a photo for your contact on the <guilabel>Misc</guilabel> tab, "
"&kmail; will show it when viewing these addresses."
msgstr ""
"Se lle pon unha foto ao contacto na pestana <guilabel>Miscelánea</guilabel>, "
"&kmail; mostraráa cando vexa estes enderezos."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:357
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "These addresses will be used in &kmail; if you type the name of the "
#| "person in either the <guilabel>\"to\"</guilabel>, <guilabel>\"cc\"</"
#| "guilabel> or <guilabel>\"bcc\"</guilabel> field of a new message."
msgid ""
"These addresses will be used in &kmail; if you type the name of the person "
"in either the <guilabel>To</guilabel>, <guilabel>CC</guilabel> or "
"<guilabel>BCC</guilabel> field of a new message."
msgstr ""
"Estes enderezos empregaranse en &kmail; se escribe o nome da persoa nos "
"campos <guilabel>\"para\"</guilabel>, <guilabel>\"cc\"</guilabel> ou "
"<guilabel>\"bcc\"</guilabel> dunha mensaxe nova."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:361
#, no-c-format
msgid "Instant Messaging"
msgstr "Mensaxería instantánea"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:362
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>IM Address</guilabel> text box holds the preferred Instant "
"Messaging Address for this contact. To add, view and edit additional IM "
"Addresses, click the <guibutton>Edit IM Addresses...</guibutton> button. The "
"<guilabel>Edit Instant Messaging Address</guilabel> dialog appears."
msgstr ""
"A caixa de texto <guilabel>Enderezo IM</guilabel> contén o enderezo de "
"mensaxería instantánea preferido para este contacto. Para engadir, ver e "
"modificar enderezos adicionais de mensaxería instantánea, prema o botón "
"<guibutton>Editar Enderezos IM</guibutton>. Aparecerá o diálogo "
"<guilabel>Editar Enderezos de Mensaxería Instantánea</guilabel>."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:366
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Edit IM Addresses Dialog"
msgstr "O diálogo Editar Enderezos de IM"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:369
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>The Edit IM Addresses Dialog.</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>O diálogo Editar Enderezos de IM.</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:370
#, no-c-format
msgid "<para>The Edit IM Addresses Dialog.</para>"
msgstr "<para>O diálogo Editar Enderezos de IM.</para>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:374
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A contact can have multiple instant messaging addresses associated with it. "
"Other applications, which are using the <application>Kimproxy</application> "
"system, such as &kopete; or &konversation; can interact using this "
"information. So in example you can associate a contact in IRC with a contact "
"in your address book. This cannot be done automatically, you have to make "
"this association manually in the specific program."
msgstr ""
"Pódenselle asociar varias contas de mensaxería instantánea a cada contacto. "
"Outras aplicacións que empreguen o sistema <application>Kimproxy</"
"application>, como &kopete; ou &konversation;, poden interactuar utilizando "
"esta información. Por exemplo, pode asociar un contacto en IRC cun contacto "
"no seu caderno de enderezos. Isto non se pode facer automaticamente, tenno "
"que facer manualmente no programa concreto."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:376
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you are not interest in whether they are picked up in another "
"application, and just want to store the instant messaging addresses with the "
"contact, then it's fine to add and edit them here. Otherwise it's "
"recommended that you let the applications do the changes and not yourself, "
"to not interfere with them."
msgstr ""
"Se non ten interese en que os utilicen outras aplicacións e simplemente "
"quere almacenar os enderezos de mensaxería instantánea co contacto, abonda "
"con engadilos e editalos aquí. De non ser así, recoméndase que lles deixe ás "
"aplicacións facer os cambios e non vostede mesmo, para así non interferir "
"con elas."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:378
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"For more information on adding new Instant Messaging Addresses, see <ulink "
"url=\"help:/kopete/getting-started.html#creating-accounts\">&kopete;'s "
"handbook</ulink> and <ulink url=\"help:/konversation/linkaddressbook.html"
"\">&konversation;'s handbook</ulink>."
msgstr ""
"Para máis información acerca de como engadir novos enderezos de mensaxería "
"instantánea, consulte o <ulink url=\"help:/kopete/getting-started."
"html#creating-accounts\">Manual de &kopete;</ulink> e o <ulink url=\"help:/"
"konversation/linkaddressbook.html\">Manual de &konversation;</ulink>."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:386
#, no-c-format
msgid "Categories"
msgstr "Categorías"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:387
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Categories help you to sort and group your contacts. You can simply add a "
"contact to one or more groups by pressing the <guibutton>Select Categories..."
"</guibutton> button."
msgstr ""
"As categorías axudan a almacenar e agrupar os contactos. Pode simplemente "
"engadir un contacto a un ou máis grupos premendo o botón "
"<guibutton>Seleccionar Categorías...</guibutton>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:388
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To add your own category or remove an unused category you can click on "
"<guibutton>Edit Categories...</guibutton>. Here you can edit, add and remove "
"categories. Please notice that it is automatically started in Edit mode."
msgstr ""
"Para engadir a súa propia categoría ou eliminar unha categoría que non use, "
"prema <guibutton>Editar Categorías...</guibutton>. Aquí pode modificar, "
"engadir e eliminar categorías. Teña en conta que se inicia automaticamente "
"en modo edición."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:392
#, no-c-format
msgid "Public, Private and Confidental"
msgstr "Público, privado e confidencial"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:393
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "The three modes Public, Private and Confidental are part of the vCard "
#| "standart and implemented as such. These allow you another way to group "
#| "your contacts."
msgid ""
"The three modes Public, Private and Confidental are part of the vCard "
"standard and implemented as such. These allow you another way to group your "
"contacts."
msgstr ""
"Os tres modos, público, privado e confidencial, son parte do padrón vCard e "
"utilízanse como tales. Permiten dispor doutro xeito de agrupar os contactos."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:398
#, no-c-format
msgid "Details tab"
msgstr "Pestana de detalles"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:399
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This is the place where you can store additional details on your contacts."
msgstr ""
"Este é o sitio no que se poden almaceder detalles adicionais sobre os "
"contactos."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:400
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "The fields are mostly self-explanatory. You will notice that the "
#| "<guilabel>Anniversary</guilabel> and <guilabel>Birthday</guilabel> dates "
#| "are listed in the <guilabel>Special Dates</guilabel> list in the "
#| "&kontact; summary."
msgid ""
"The fields are mostly self-explanatory. You will notice that the "
"<guilabel>Anniversary</guilabel> and <guilabel>Birthday</guilabel> dates are "
"listed in the <guilabel>Special Dates</guilabel> list in the &kontact; "
"summary."
msgstr ""
"Os campos explícanse por si mesmos. Verá que as datas <guilabel>Aniversario</"
"guilabel> e <guilabel>Cumpreanos</guilabel> aparecen listadas na listaxe "
"<guilabel>Datas Especiais</guilabel> do resumo de &kontact;."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:404
#, no-c-format
msgid "Crypto Settings tab"
msgstr "Pestana de configuración criptográfica"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:405
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In this tab, you can define preferences with regards to cryptography for a "
"contact. At the time of this writing, only &kmail; and &kontact; will make "
"use of these preferences when composing messages. This mechanism replaces "
"the barely editable per-recipient crypto preferences of earlier &kmail; "
"releases."
msgstr ""
"Nesta pestana pode definir preferencias relacionadas co cifrado para un "
"contacto. Cando se escribe isto, só &kmail; e &kontact; utilizan estas "
"preferencias ao redixir mensaxes. Este mecanismo substitúe as preferencias "
"de cifrado por destinatario que apenas se podían modificar nas edicións "
"anteriores de &kmail;."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:416
#, no-c-format
msgid "Allowed Protocols"
msgstr "Protocolos permitidos"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:419
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Here, you can restrict the cryptographic message formats that can be used "
"for this contact. See the section on <ulink url=\"/kmail/the-composer-window."
"html#cryptographic-message-formats\">Cryptographic Message Formats</ulink> "
"in <ulink url=\"/kmail/\">&kmail;'s handbook</ulink> for a discussion of the "
"different available formats."
msgstr ""
"Aquí pode restrinxir os formatos de mensaxes cifrados que se poden empregar "
"con este contacto. Consulte a sección acerca de <ulink url=\"/kmail/the-"
"composer-window.html#cryptographic-message-formats\">formatos de mensaxes "
"criptográficos</ulink> do <ulink url=\"/kmail/\">Manual de &kmail;</ulink> "
"para un tratamento dos diferentes formatos disponíbeis."

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:432
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Preferred OpenPGP encryption key</guilabel>, <guilabel>Preferred "
"&smime; encryption certificate</guilabel>"
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Chave de cifrado OpenPGP preferida</guilabel>, "
"<guilabel>certificado de cifrado &smime; preferido</guilabel>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:437
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Here, you can assign a preferred OpenPGP key and/or &smime; certificate to "
"be used when encrypting to this contact. Otherwise, the local keyring and "
"local certificate box are searched for matching keys and certificates."
msgstr ""
"Aquí pode asignar unha chave OpenPGP preferida e/ou un certificado &smime; a "
"usar ao cifrar mensaxes para este contacto. De non o facer, procurarase no "
"chaveiro local e na caixa de certificados local para atopar chaves e "
"certificados coincidentes."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:448
#, no-c-format
msgid "Message Preference"
msgstr "Preferencias das mensaxes"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:451
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Here, you can select from a set of directives for user interaction both when "
"signing and when encrypting."
msgstr ""
"Aquí pode seleccionar dentre un conxunto de directivas para a interacción co "
"usuario tanto cando asine como cando cifre."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:458
#, no-c-format
msgid "&lt;none&gt;"
msgstr "&lt;ningunha&gt;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:461
#, no-c-format
msgid "No preference, use whatever mode &kmail; defaults to."
msgstr "Ningunha preferencia, utilizar o modo que teña &kmail;."

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:468
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guilabel>Never Sign</guilabel>, <guilabel>Never Encrypt</guilabel>"
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Non Asinar Nunca</guilabel>, <guilabel>Non Cifrar Nunca</guilabel>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:472
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Never sign (encrypt) messages to this contact. Don't ask for confirmation "
"(except in the case of conflicts with preferences of other contacts)."
msgstr ""
"Non asinar (cifrar) mensaxes destinadas a este contacto. Non pedir "
"confirmación (excepto no caso de conflitos coas preferencias doutros "
"contactos)."

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:481
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guilabel>Always Sign</guilabel>, <guilabel>Always Encrypt</guilabel>"
msgstr "<guilabel>Asinar Sempre</guilabel>, <guilabel>Cifrar Sempre</guilabel>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:486
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Always sign (encrypt) messages to the contact. Don't ask for confirmation "
"(except in the case of conflicts with preferences of other contacts)."
msgstr ""
"Asinar (cifrar) sempre as mensaxes destinadas ao contacto. Non pedir "
"confirmación (excepto no caso de conflitos coas preferencias doutros "
"contactos)."

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:495
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Always Sign If Possible</guilabel>, <guilabel>Always Encrypt If "
"Possible</guilabel>"
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Asinar Sempre Se É Posíbel</guilabel>, <guilabel>Cifrar Sempre Se "
"É Posíbel</guilabel>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:500
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "Always sign (encrypt) messages to this contact when it would be possible "
#| "to do so. Don't ask if it isn't possible. Situations in which signing "
#| "might not be possible include other recipients having signing preferences "
#| "of \"Never\". Situations in which encryption might not be possible "
#| "include missing keys/certificates for this or other recievers."
msgid ""
"Always sign (encrypt) messages to this contact when it would be possible to "
"do so. Don't ask if it isn't possible. Situations in which signing might not "
"be possible include other recipients having signing preferences of \"Never"
"\". Situations in which encryption might not be possible include missing "
"keys/certificates for this or other receivers."
msgstr ""
"Asinar (cifrar) sempre as mensaxas destinadas a este contacto cando sexa "
"posíbel facelo. Non preguntar de non ser posíbel. As situacións nas que a "
"sinatura podería non ser posíbel inclúen que outros destinatarios teñan a "
"preferencia de asinar como \"Nunca\". As situación nas que o cifrado podería "
"non ser posíbel inclúen a ausencia de chaves/certificados para este "
"destinatario ou para outros."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:514
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guilabel>Ask</guilabel>"
msgstr "<guilabel>Preguntar</guilabel>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:517
#, no-c-format
msgid "Always ask whether to sign (encrypt)."
msgstr "Preguntar sempre se se asina (ou cifra)."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:528
#, no-c-format
msgid "Misc tab"
msgstr "Pestana Miscelánea"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:529
#, no-c-format
msgid "This describes the <guilabel>Misc</guilabel> settings tab"
msgstr ""
"Aquí se describe a pestana de configuración <guilabel>Miscelánea</guilabel>"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:532
#, no-c-format
msgid "<title>Geo Data</title>"
msgstr "<title>Datos xeográficos</title>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:533
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "Here you can enter the contact's geographical location, with "
#| "<guilabel>Latitude</guilabel> and <guilabel>Longitude</guilabel>. To "
#| "\"enable\" them simply click on the check box <guilabel>use geo data</"
#| "guilabel>. After that you can either enter the coordinates by hand or "
#| "click on <guilabel>Edit Geo Data...</guilabel> to select them on a world "
#| "map."
msgid ""
"Here you can enter the contact's geographical location, with "
"<guilabel>Latitude</guilabel> and <guilabel>Longitude</guilabel>. To \"enable"
"\" them simply click on the check box <guilabel>Use geo data</guilabel>. "
"After that you can either enter the coordinates by hand or click on "
"<guilabel>Edit Geo Data...</guilabel> to select them on a world map."
msgstr ""
"Aquí se pode introducir a localización xeográfica do contacto, com "
"<guilabel>Latitude</guilabel> e <guilabel>Lonxitude</guilabel>. Para "
"\"activalas\", simplemente prema na caixiña <guilabel>Empregar Datos "
"Xeográficos...</guilabel> para escollelos nun mapa do mundo."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:536
#, no-c-format
msgid "Sound"
msgstr "Son"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:537
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can store a spoken version of the name here. It is helpful for foreign "
"names."
msgstr ""
"Aquí pode gardar unha versión falada do nome. Resulta útil para os nomes "
"estranxeiros."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:538
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"However this is part of the vCard 2.1 standard and only supports the three "
"formats: WAVE, PCM, AIFF."
msgstr ""
"Porén, isto fai parte do padrón vCard 2.1 e só permite os tres formatos: "
"WAVE, PCM e AIFF."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:539
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Select <guibutton>Store as URL</guibutton> if the sound lies on a remote "
"machine."
msgstr ""
"Seleccione <guibutton>Gravar como URL</guibutton> se o son está nunha "
"máquina remota."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:542
#, no-c-format
msgid "Photo and Logo"
msgstr "Foto e logo"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:543
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"By clicking on the buddy icon you can select and scale a picture of your "
"contact."
msgstr ""
"Prema na icona do homiño para escoller e modificar o tamaño dunha imaxe do "
"seu contacto."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:544
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The Photo will be shown in the contact preview and in the Icon view mode. "
"However the Logo picture will only be shown in Icon view and only if there's "
"no photo available."
msgstr ""
"A foto aparecerá na vista previa do contacto e no modo de vista por iconas. "
"Porén, a imaxe do logo só aparecerá na vista por iconas e só se non se "
"dispón de foto."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:545
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "To reset a photo or logo simply right click on it and select "
#| "<guilabel>Reset</guilabel>."
msgid ""
"To reset a photo or logo simply click on it with the &RMB; and select "
"<guilabel>Reset</guilabel>."
msgstr ""
"Para limpar unha foto ou logo, simplemente prema co botón dereito do rato e "
"seleccione <guilabel>Restablecer</guilabel>."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:548
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid "Location of Free/Busy informations"
msgid "Location of Free/Busy information"
msgstr "Localización de información dispoñíbel/non dispoñíbel"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:549
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Here you can select a path to a contact's Free/Busy information, which are "
"used when you add him to an event in &korganizer; or &kontact;'s calendar "
"view."
msgstr ""
"Aquí pode seleccionar unha rota á información de disponibilidade dun "
"contacto, que se utiliza cando o engade a un evento na vista de calendario "
"de &korganizer; ou de &kontact;."

