#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:753
#, no-c-format
msgid "Import"
msgstr "Importar"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:754
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kaddressbook; is able to import the following formats:"
msgstr "&kaddressbook; pode importar os formatos seguintes:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:759
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"With this entry you can import your contacts from the vCard format "
"(<acronym>RFC</acronym> 2426)."
msgstr ""
"Con esta entrada pódense importar contactos desde o formato vCard "
"(<acronym>RFC</acronym> 2426)."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:763
#, no-c-format
msgid "MS Exchange Personal Address Book (.PAB)"
msgstr "MS Exchange Personal Address Book (.PAB)"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:764
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"With this entry you can import your contacts from your Address book on a MS "
"Exchange personal address book, which is used by MS Outlook and MS Outlook "
"Express to store their contact data."
msgstr ""
"Con esta entrada pódense importar contactos desde un caderno de enderezos "
"dun caderno de enderzos persoais de MS Exchange, que utilizan MS Outlook e "
"MS Outlook Express para almacenar os seus datos de contactos."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:769
#, no-c-format
msgid "Eudora Addressbook"
msgstr "Caderno de enderezos de Eudora"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:770
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"With this plugin you can import your contacts from the Eudora mail client."
msgstr ""
"Con esta extensión pódense importar contactos desde o cliente de correo "
"Eudora."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:776 index.docbook:814
#, no-c-format
msgid "CSV List"
msgstr "Lista CSV"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:777
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"CSV (comma separated value) is a format that is used by many (address book) "
"applications."
msgstr ""
"CSV (valores separados por vírgulas) é un formato empregado por moitas "
"aplicacións (de caderno de enderezos)."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:782
#, no-c-format
msgid "Opera Addressbook"
msgstr "Caderno de enderezos de Opera"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:783
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"With this entry you can import your contacts from the Opera web browser."
msgstr ""
"Con esta entrada pódense importar contactos desde o navegador web Opera."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:787
#, no-c-format
msgid "KDE 2 Addressbook"
msgstr "Caderno de enderezos de KDE 2"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:788
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"With this entry you can import your old contacts from a &kde; 2.x "
"installation."
msgstr ""
"Con esta entrada pódense importar contactos vellos desde unha instalación "
"&kde; 2.x."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:792 index.docbook:820
#, no-c-format
msgid "LDIF Addressbook"
msgstr "Caderno de enderezos LDIF"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:793 index.docbook:821
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"LDIF is a plain-text representation of LDAP data, used by &Netscape; and "
"Mozilla to store their address book data."
msgstr ""
"LDIP é unha representación en texto simple de datos LDAP e utilízanna "
"&Netscape; e Mozilla para almacenar os datos do seu caderno de enderezos."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:797 index.docbook:825
#, no-c-format
msgid "GMX Address Book"
msgstr "Caderno de enderezos de GMX"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:798 index.docbook:826 index.docbook:836
#, no-c-format
msgid "To be written."
msgstr "Ainda por escribir."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:804
#, no-c-format
msgid "Export"
msgstr "Exportar"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:805
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kaddressbook; is able to export into the following formats:"
msgstr "&kaddressbook; pode exportar aos formatos seguintes:"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:809
#, no-c-format
msgid "vCard 2.1 &#038; 3.0"
msgstr "vCard 2.1 &#038; 3.0"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:810
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "With this entry you can import your contacts from the vCard format "
#| "(<acronym>RFC</acronym> 2426). You can either export it into the 2.1 or "
#| "in the 3.0 compatibel version of the vCard standard."
msgid ""
"With this entry you can export your contacts to the vCard format "
"(<acronym>RFC</acronym> 2426). You can either export it into the 2.1 or in "
"the 3.0 compatible version of the vCard standard."
msgstr ""
"Con esta entrada pódese exportar contactos ao formato vCard (<acronym>RFC</"
"acronym> 2426). Pódense exportar ás versións 2.1 ou 3.0 do padrón vCard."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:815
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "CSV (comma separated value) is a format that is used by many (address "
#| "book) applications, it stores the contact informations in a plaintext "
#| "field seperated by commas. This makes CSV very flexible and good for "
#| "interaction with scripts."
msgid ""
"CSV (comma separated value) is a format that is used by many (address book) "
"applications, it stores the contact information in a plaintext field "
"separated by commas. This makes CSV very flexible and good for interaction "
"with scripts."
msgstr ""
"CSV (valores separados por vírgulas) é un formato empregado por moitas "
"aplicacións (de caderno de enderezos); almacena as informacións sobre so "
"contactos en campos en texto simple separados por vírgulas. Isto fai que CSV "
"sexa moi flexíbel e bon para interaccionar con guións."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:830
#, no-c-format
msgid "Bookmarks Menu"
msgstr "Menú de marcadores"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:831
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This exports the stored URLs of your contacts into the &konqueror; bookmarks "
"system."
msgstr ""
"Isto exporta os URLs dos contactos almacenados no sistema de marcadores de "
"&konqueror;."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:835
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guilabel>Geo Data</guilabel>"
msgstr "<guilabel>Datos Xeográficos</guilabel>"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:845
#, no-c-format
msgid "LDAP queries"
msgstr "Pesquisas LDAP"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:846
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Address information from LDAP servers can be imported into &kaddressbook;'s "
"local address book by using the LDAP search dialog."
msgstr ""
"Pódese importar a información sobre enderezos LDAP ao caderno de enderezos "
"de &kaddressbook; empregando o diálogo de procura LDAP."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:850
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To configure (a number of) LDAP servers, use the <link linkend=\"preferences-"
"ldap-lookup\">configuration dialog.</link>"
msgstr ""
"Para configurar (varios) servidores LDAP, empregue o <link linkend="
"\"preferences-ldap-lookup\">diálogo de configuración.</link>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:854
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"On the main toolbar in &kaddressbook; a button with a picture of a "
"magnifying glass over a book is available: use this button to open the LDAP "
"search dialog. The dialog itself is pretty straight forward; just type in "
"parts of a name, email address or phone number and press the "
"<guibutton>Search</guibutton> button."
msgstr ""
"Na barra de ferramentas principal de &kaddressbook; hai un botón cunha imaxe "
"dunha lupa sobre un libro: empregue este botón para abrir o diálogo de "
"procuras LDAP. O diálogo explícase por si mesmo; simplemente escriba partes "
"dun nome, enderezo de correo electrónico ou número de teléfono e prema o "
"botón <guibutton>Procurar</guibutton>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:861
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When the results display in the listbox it is possible to select one or more "
"address(es); you can then use the <guibutton>Add Selected</guibutton> to "
"import the selected address(es) to the local address book, or click the "
"<guibutton>Send email to Contact</guibutton> to invoke a mail program to "
"write an email to the selected recipients."
msgstr ""
"Ao apareceren os resultados na caixa de selección, será posíbel seleccionar "
"un ou máis enderezos. Prema <guibutton>Engadir Seleccionados</guibutton> "
"para importar o(s) enderezo(s) seleccionados para o caderno de enderezos "
"local, ou prema <guibutton>Enviar correo a Contacto</guibutton> para invocar "
"un programa de correo e escribirlle unha mensaxe de correo aos destinatarios "
"seleccionados."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:867
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guibutton>Recursive search</guibutton> check box is enabled by default; "
"this will make the LDAP query consider all objects below the base DN of each "
"server. If you only want to consider objects one level below the base "
"uncheck this check box; if in doubt, leave it checked."
msgstr ""
"A caixiña <guibutton>Procura recursiva</guibutton> está activada por "
"omisión; con isto, a pesquisa LDAP considerará todos os obxectos por baixo "
"do DN base de cada servidor. Se só quere considerar os obxectos que estean "
"un nivel por debaixo da base, retírelle a marca a esta caixiña; se ten "
"dúbidas, déixea marcada."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:877
#, no-c-format
msgid "Preferences"
msgstr "Preferencias"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:879
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "You can modify many aspects of &kaddressbook;'s behavior in the "
